{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model integrating resnet50 image encoder with an existing multiprofile RNA-only baseline (scvi_n200, avgpool) to assess image data impact. Validation accuracy of 0.6315 (F1 0.6068) slightly underperforms the RNA-only baseline (0.6501 accuracy), suggesting image integration may not improve performance. The exact contribution of the image encoder and concat fusion remains uncertain due to limited comparative evidence and potential confounding factors from the multiprofile setting."
}

